            "review_title": "Review at 4An Authentic Vietnamese Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Thao Eva\n1 contribution\n0\nVietnamese's Food\nSep 2019\nThis is the first time I'm eating at a Vegetarian Restaurant in Vietnam. It was a beautiful day in September. I went out to eat with my friends. I was verry impressed with design Restaurant, very fresh,... The staff in here was very sociable,.. And the food was very delicious, it was arranged very lovely,...To sum up, 4An will be an amazing experience that shouldn't be missed\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 18, 2019",
